# Corridor Maintenance App — deploy hygiene
# Phase 1: keep local Firebase/service files out of public Pages deploys.
# NOTE: seed/migrate utilities are still TRACKED and REQUIRED for initial
# production setup. Do NOT delete them yet. Before the final public
# resident-facing deploy, either:
#   (a) move them to a private admin repo/branch, or
#   (b) `git rm` them listed below, or
#   (c) deploy Pages from a clean `public/` export that excludes them.
# This .gitignore only prevents NEW local copies/keys from being committed.

# Local Firebase CLI / emulator artefacts
.firebase/
.firestore-indexes-local.json
firestore-debug.log
ui-debug.log
firebase-debug.log

# Node / functions artefacts (functions/ deps are installed at deploy time)
node_modules/
functions/node_modules/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json

# Local env / keys — never commit real secrets here
.env
.env.*
*.key.json
serviceAccount*.json
